            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.98</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed a crash that could happen when you closed a popped-out pane&#x27;s window, such as a browser, to dock it back in. The workspace no longer collapses to the docked pane&#x27;s width and pulls the main window below its minimum size, which used to start a resize loop that crashed the app.</li>
<li>The main window now stays at or above its minimum size even when its contents try to make it narrower or shorter.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
